// BT-4837 / BT-4828 fixture: a protocol in its own file whose provided method
// raises. An actor in another file `uses:` it, and the actor frame must show
// this file's line (adr0139_frames.btscript).

Protocol define: Adr0139Provision
  label -> String

  boomP -> Object => Erlang maps get: #missing from: (Dictionary new)
